          ],
          "product_names": [
            "Connect 2026"
          ],
          "component_type": "smart_glasses",
          "metric_value": "",
          "unit": "",
          "source_quote": "Whatever Zuckerberg and Meta have to say about smart glasses will be particularly notable. The company is dealing with an outpouring of privacy and harassment concerns stemming from the product line’s built-in camera, which has led to them being derided as “pervert glasses.” Meta has already tried to tackle that reputation with recent privacy fixes and a new marketing campaign, but it could introduce more updates on the Connect stage.",
